{"3921270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blood & Money", "steam_appid": 3921270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blood &amp; Money</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood &amp; Money delivers relentless Gauntlet-style co-op carnage, powered by a raw punk rock soundtrack and retro 256-color art. Join a friend to blast through monster-filled dungeons with fireballs and explosives, grabbing loot in a kingdom torn by a traitor’s pact. Retro action awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/6c005375a95845e8d3d62558bdf0cd61.poster.avif?t=1761920797\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/6c005375a95845e8d3d62558bdf0cd61.webm?t=1761920797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/6c005375a95845e8d3d62558bdf0cd61.mp4?t=1761920797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eons ago, a traitor king’s unholy pact with a dark sorceress unleashed a monstrous plague upon the land, turning a once-proud kingdom into a blood-soaked wasteland. You and your ally must banish these beasts from the cursed islands, wielding fireballs and bombs to reclaim glory. Will you triumph, or join the fallen in the gods’ judgment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from six characters with unique stats to unleash fireballs, bombs, and an arsenal of potions, spells, and magical items, shredding monsters in fountains of gore. Explore dungeons with fluid, eight-way movement and spend hard-earned coins on stat boosts in shops. Join a friend in two-player co-op to dominate the blood-soaked battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/bc64dee719ba5d5496761278c45c6c1c.poster.avif?t=1761920797\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/bc64dee719ba5d5496761278c45c6c1c.webm?t=1761920797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/bc64dee719ba5d5496761278c45c6c1c.mp4?t=1761920797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Piles of coins from shredded enemies fuel your shopping spree with the cigarette girl, a shadowy vendor roaming the cursed kingdom. Grab food, bombs, potions, spellbooks, or magic items, and boost your stats to survive the relentless onslaught of monsters ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/70c5a42583bd36808b885460a6cc273c.avif?t=1761920797\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two-Player Co-op Chaos: Team up for local or remote play together, synergizing or stealing loot in blood-soaked dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-Style Action: Pick-up-and-play controls deliver instant thrills for retro arcade fans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra-Violent Combat: Obliterate skeletons, zombies, and more with gory, over-the-top kills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stat-Boost Upgrades: Buy speed, power, or durability boosts to customize your hero for the fight ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >256-Color Pixel Art: Gritty, retro-inspired visuals bring vibrant, blood-drenched arenas to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punk Rock Soundtrack: A blistering score fuels every battle, amplifying the chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blood &amp; Money</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood &amp; Money delivers relentless Gauntlet-style co-op carnage, powered by a raw punk rock soundtrack and retro 256-color art. Join a friend to blast through monster-filled dungeons with fireballs and explosives, grabbing loot in a kingdom torn by a traitor’s pact. Retro action awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/6c005375a95845e8d3d62558bdf0cd61.poster.avif?t=1761920797\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/6c005375a95845e8d3d62558bdf0cd61.webm?t=1761920797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/6c005375a95845e8d3d62558bdf0cd61.mp4?t=1761920797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eons ago, a traitor king’s unholy pact with a dark sorceress unleashed a monstrous plague upon the land, turning a once-proud kingdom into a blood-soaked wasteland. You and your ally must banish these beasts from the cursed islands, wielding fireballs and bombs to reclaim glory. Will you triumph, or join the fallen in the gods’ judgment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from six characters with unique stats to unleash fireballs, bombs, and an arsenal of potions, spells, and magical items, shredding monsters in fountains of gore. Explore dungeons with fluid, eight-way movement and spend hard-earned coins on stat boosts in shops. Join a friend in two-player co-op to dominate the blood-soaked battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/bc64dee719ba5d5496761278c45c6c1c.poster.avif?t=1761920797\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/bc64dee719ba5d5496761278c45c6c1c.webm?t=1761920797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/bc64dee719ba5d5496761278c45c6c1c.mp4?t=1761920797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Piles of coins from shredded enemies fuel your shopping spree with the cigarette girl, a shadowy vendor roaming the cursed kingdom. Grab food, bombs, potions, spellbooks, or magic items, and boost your stats to survive the relentless onslaught of monsters ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/70c5a42583bd36808b885460a6cc273c.avif?t=1761920797\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two-Player Co-op Chaos: Team up for local or remote play together, synergizing or stealing loot in blood-soaked dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-Style Action: Pick-up-and-play controls deliver instant thrills for retro arcade fans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra-Violent Combat: Obliterate skeletons, zombies, and more with gory, over-the-top kills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stat-Boost Upgrades: Buy speed, power, or durability boosts to customize your hero for the fight ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >256-Color Pixel Art: Gritty, retro-inspired visuals bring vibrant, blood-drenched arenas to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punk Rock Soundtrack: A blistering score fuels every battle, amplifying the chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Blood &amp; Money: A Gauntlet-style co-op dungeon crawler packed with gore and loot. Explore cursed dungeons with six unique characters, slaying monsters in bloody chaos. Grab coins, upgrade stats, and dominate the battlefield! Wishlist now.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/46e9d0ceea236f30a962ea4b2f0270666e072513/header.jpg?t=1761920797", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/e59ff080f082fa953f5d58bf7e079e6ef2641d55/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761920797", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/e59ff080f082fa953f5d58bf7e079e6ef2641d55/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761920797", "website": "https://paradise-multimedia.co.uk/blood-and-money", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 6th Gen i5 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb